建立；同名與世襲官號不得全庫合併，本名未見不補造。","review":"ai_provisional","family_path":{"connection":"father","generation_distance":1,"status":"contextual_provisional","human_reviewed":false,"evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-039-jin","source_id":"s-shiji-039-jin","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-039-jin:p114","quote":"悼公周者，其大父捷，晉襄公少子也，不得立，號爲桓叔，桓叔最愛。桓叔生惠伯談，談生悼公周。周之立，年十四矣。悼公曰：「大父、父皆不得立而辟難於周，客死焉。寡人自以疎遠，毋幾爲君。今大夫不忘文、襄之意而惠立桓叔之後，賴宗廟大夫之靈，得奉晉祀，豈敢不戰戰乎？大夫其亦佐寡人！」於是逐不臣者七人，修舊功，施德惠，收文公入時功臣後。秋，伐鄭。鄭師敗，遂至陳。","source_term":"談生悼公周"}],"source_assertion_id":"a-shiji039-053","interpretation_note":"以此受傳正文的明示近親主張配置局部家族；不合併跨篇候選身份、不補闕名世代，不表示遠祖世系已核實。分支字元不是長幼排行。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","parent_person_id":"6di_ywz_ju4_AAADAA"}},{"id":"wae_xmq_dqk","label":"楊干（魏世家候選）","status":"active","historicity":"historical_tradition","aliases":[{"surface":"楊干","mention_ids":["c-shiji-044-wei:m006-0019","c-shiji-044-wei:m006-0028"]}],"evidence":[{"mention_id":"c-shiji-044-wei:m006-0019","chapter_id":"c-shiji-044-wei","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-044-wei:p006","quote":"楊干"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-044-wei:m006-0028","chapter_id":"c-shiji-044-wei","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-044-wei:p006","quote":"楊干"}]}],"source_mention_summary":[{"source_id":"s-shiji-044-wei","work_id":"w-shiji","book_id":"b-shiji-044","chapter_id":"c-shiji-044-wei","mention_count":2,"mention_ids":["c-shiji-044-wei:m006-0019","c-shiji-044-wei:m006-0028"],"paragraph_ids":["c-shiji-044-wei:p006"],"table_cell_ids":[],"passage_count":1}],"most_mentioned_source_ids":["s-shiji-044-wei"],"mention_count_policy":{"scope":"currently_annotated_mentions","included_kinds":["paragraph","table_cell"],"identity_policy":"contextual_provisional","ties":"all_maxima","frequency_is_not_authority":true},"kinship_interpretation_cases":[],"reported_variants":[],"family_tree_decisions":[],"preferred_relations":[{"id":"a-shiji044-004","subject_person_id":"wae_xmq_dqk","predicate":"brother","object_person_id":"6di_ywz_ju4_AAADAAA","status":"source_attested","evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-044-wei","source_id":"s-shiji-044-wei","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-044-wei:p006","quote":"魏絳事晉悼公。悼公三年，會諸侯。悼公弟楊干亂行，魏絳僇辱楊干。悼公怒曰：『合諸侯以爲榮，今辱吾弟！』將誅魏絳。或説悼公，悼公止。卒任魏絳政，使和戎、翟，戎、翟親附。悼公之十一年，曰：『自吾用魏絳，八年之中，九合諸侯，戎、翟和，子之力也。』賜之樂，三讓，然後受之。徙治安邑。魏絳卒，諡爲昭子。生魏嬴。嬴生魏獻子。"}],"qualifiers":{"source_term":"悼公弟楊干","historicity":"historical_tradition"},"interpretation_note":"明示生、孫與弟按來源保存；祖孫不改父子，苗裔不補闕代，未依先後繼位推親屬。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"family_tree_policy":{"default":"editorial_preferred","original_assertions_preserved":true,"unreviewed_conflicts_may_remain":true,"runtime_ai_required":false},"family_paths":[],"mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-044-wei:m006-0019","start":19,"end":21,"surface":"楊干","kind":"person","person_id":"wae_xmq_dqk","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-044-wei:p006","chapter_id":"c-shiji-044-wei"},{"id":"c-shiji-044-wei:m006-0028","start":28,"end":30,"surface":"楊干","kind":"person","person_id":"wae_xmq_dqk","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-044-wei:p006","chapter_id":"c-shiji-044-wei"}],"relations":[{"id":"a-shiji044-004","subject_person_id":"wae_xmq_dqk","predicate":"brother","object_person_id":"6di_ywz_ju4_AAADAAA","status":"source_attested","evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-044-wei","source_id":"s-shiji-044-wei","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-044-wei:p006","quote":"魏絳事晉悼公。悼公三年，會諸侯。悼公弟楊干亂行，魏絳僇辱楊干。悼公怒曰：『合諸侯以爲榮，今辱吾弟！』將誅魏絳。或説悼公，悼公止。卒任魏絳政，使和戎、翟，戎、翟親附。悼公之十一年，曰：『自吾用魏絳，八年之中，九合諸侯，戎、翟和，子之力也。』賜之樂，三讓，然後受之。徙治安邑。魏絳卒，諡爲昭子。生魏嬴。嬴生魏獻子。"}],"qualifiers":{"source_term":"悼公弟楊干","historicity":"historical_tradition"},"interpretation_note":"明示生、孫與弟按來源保存；祖孫不改父子，苗裔不補闕代，未依先後繼位推親屬。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"title_holdings":[],"address_assertions":[],"table_occurrences":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"preferred_birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[{"id":"d-shiji044-014","person_id":"wae_xmq_dqk","surfaces":["楊干"],"scope":"same_chapter","chapter_ids":["c-shiji-044-wei"],"status":"contextual_provisional","evidence":[{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-0